(3306027, 459304, 57378, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little trouble with the exposure here  - I presume it is far too underexposed due to the reading being taken from the center of the cameras lens which happens to be the bright window. Try taking an exposure from the items inside or using the exposure lock (Which most cameras - including compact cameras have) This will help you with better exposure and no doubt score.</td>', 'Looks like a little trouble with the exposure here  - I presume it is far too underexposed due to the reading being taken from the center of the cameras lens which happens to be the bright window. Try taking an exposure from the items inside or using the exposure lock (Which most cameras - including compact cameras have) This will help you with better exposure and no doubt score.', '2007-01-31 03:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
