(3306572, 461164, 51793, '<td valign="top">Not really much of a table top here. Although the effect of milk jumping out of a wine glass is a bit fuzzy and unclear it is a cool effect. Image is not 100% clear and I have learned that the critics on this site will score you pretty low on liquid motion if it has any blur on it at all.</td>', 'Not really much of a table top here. Although the effect of milk jumping out of a wine glass is a bit fuzzy and unclear it is a cool effect. Image is not 100% clear and I have learned that the critics on this site will score you pretty low on liquid motion if it has any blur on it at all.', '2007-01-31 07:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
