(3306853, 461217, 28261, '<td valign="top">Image has a yellow cast to it.  Most likely caused by Fluorescent lights.  Find your white balance setting before taking pictures in this lighting and manually set it to the fluorescent setting rather than Auto.  This really will help to remove the yellow.<br/> <br/>Appears that you could have used a bit more focus or a higher number on your f-stop to allow for more depth of field. <br/> <br/>Good attempt, but only the flags appear in focus.</td>', 'Image has a yellow cast to it.  Most likely caused by Fluorescent lights.  Find your white balance setting before taking pictures in this lighting and manually set it to the fluorescent setting rather than Auto.  This really will help to remove the yellow. Appears that you could have used a bit more focus or a higher number on your f-stop to allow for more depth of field.  Good attempt, but only the flags appear in focus.', '2007-01-31 08:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
