(3308865, 460822, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very cute and original.  Meets the challenge perfectly. I love the composition but would like to mention a couple of things that would have made it a 10 for me.  First I would like to have seen better symetry on the girl and her reflection, at least both eyes in the reflection.  Next I would love for this to break the rules and be perfectly centered.  Lastly I would have liked it sharper in the eyes.   Very good shot..8</td>', 'Very cute and original.  Meets the challenge perfectly. I love the composition but would like to mention a couple of things that would have made it a 10 for me.  First I would like to have seen better symetry on the girl and her reflection, at least both eyes in the reflection.  Next I would love for this to break the rules and be perfectly centered.  Lastly I would have liked it sharper in the eyes.   Very good shot..8', '2007-01-31 15:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3308870, 459557, 73235, '<td valign="top">great DOF. brilliant colors, guess you applied the "rules of 3"?</td>', 'great DOF. brilliant colors, guess you applied the "rules of 3"?', '2007-01-31 15:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
