(3308894, 461401, 68256, '<td valign="top">I bet you are getting a lot of DNMC because of the "place it on a table top" sentence.  I think you should really gained back any deducts with the "The idea is to get a photograph from an alternate perspective not normally viewed" aspect of your shot.  It is a great sky and perspective but the dark trees aren''t too attractive for me.  I think it would have been more interesting for me if I could see the road vanishing and especially the curve in the road shown more. 5</td>', 'I bet you are getting a lot of DNMC because of the "place it on a table top" sentence.  I think you should really gained back any deducts with the "The idea is to get a photograph from an alternate perspective not normally viewed" aspect of your shot.  It is a great sky and perspective but the dark trees aren''t too attractive for me.  I think it would have been more interesting for me if I could see the road vanishing and especially the curve in the road shown more. 5', '2007-01-31 15:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
