(3308975, 458680, 68256, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective (which is the idea right?).  One of my favorites so far.  I love the blown out window at the end and also the isles..kinda weird I know.  Anyway this is a wonderful photo, thanks.  One negative for me is that it seems like the left books are softer focus than the right?  That is probably just an optical illusion.</td>', 'Interesting perspective (which is the idea right?).  One of my favorites so far.  I love the blown out window at the end and also the isles..kinda weird I know.  Anyway this is a wonderful photo, thanks.  One negative for me is that it seems like the left books are softer focus than the right?  That is probably just an optical illusion.', '2007-01-31 15:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
