(3309010, 461224, 68256, '<td valign="top">On my monitor it looks like the focus was a little long (on the books).  I think this would have been a very good shot but the lighting is harsh and the table cutting through their eyes looks weird instead of interesting.  I think if you could have had them come up a little so they had 4 eyes it would have been better at least in my opinion.  Idea and composition are both great.</td>', 'On my monitor it looks like the focus was a little long (on the books).  I think this would have been a very good shot but the lighting is harsh and the table cutting through their eyes looks weird instead of interesting.  I think if you could have had them come up a little so they had 4 eyes it would have been better at least in my opinion.  Idea and composition are both great.', '2007-01-31 15:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
