(3310574, 461330, 40580, '<td valign="top">You''re going to get dinged on the size and I normally ding your size too.  But this size does it for me.  If it was bigger, it would be too distracting.  I''m going to give you above average scores.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'You''re going to get dinged on the size and I normally ding your size too.  But this size does it for me.  If it was bigger, it would be too distracting.  I''m going to give you above average scores. Good luck.', '2007-01-31 22:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
