(3317446, 459838, 67739, '<td valign="top">oh man, i know this scene all too well myself. His face just says it all "damn it its late... AH WTF its already 4! AHH" or something along those lines. i erally like the reclfection. I think this might be something worth reshooting with more of an ultra wide or something just to accentuate the mood just a tiny bit more.</td>', 'oh man, i know this scene all too well myself. His face just says it all "damn it its late... AH WTF its already 4! AHH" or something along those lines. i erally like the reclfection. I think this might be something worth reshooting with more of an ultra wide or something just to accentuate the mood just a tiny bit more.', '2007-02-02 03:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3317458, 459777, 67739, '<td valign="top">nice! i like this one a lot. I love the detail in the figure, the checkard board is a nice contrast the only thing, even though its something small, that bothers be is the edge of the board where the checkers end and theres the rim or edge. This doesnt by any means ruin the picture i just think that if it wasnt there itd add to the picture. Clean cut edges of the boat rather then this kinda random color buffer. either way great work, i love this piece.</td>', 'nice! i like this one a lot. I love the detail in the figure, the checkard board is a nice contrast the only thing, even though its something small, that bothers be is the edge of the board where the checkers end and theres the rim or edge. This doesnt by any means ruin the picture i just think that if it wasnt there itd add to the picture. Clean cut edges of the boat rather then this kinda random color buffer. either way great work, i love this piece.', '2007-02-02 03:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
