(3319696, 460266, 69387, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, this is both hilarious and sick. Someboy please free this thing off! Nice clarity. Border doesn''t do much for me. A 6.</td>', 'Oh my goodness, this is both hilarious and sick. Someboy please free this thing off! Nice clarity. Border doesn''t do much for me. A 6.', '2007-02-02 17:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
