(3320129, 461085, 70501, '<td valign="top">Man that is one eerie ornament. Image wise, although I get that it''s supposed to be a nightime setting, it is too dim, which  makes the subject more sinister looking (instead of joyful). Maybe if the subject was more crisp it would have helped. Good luck.</td>', 'Man that is one eerie ornament. Image wise, although I get that it''s supposed to be a nightime setting, it is too dim, which  makes the subject more sinister looking (instead of joyful). Maybe if the subject was more crisp it would have helped. Good luck.', '2007-02-02 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3320136, 461420, 70501, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing flash was used here? It works well!</td>', 'I''m guessing flash was used here? It works well!', '2007-02-02 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3320142, 458935, 70501, '<td valign="top">Even after brightening up my monitor settings, I still couldn''t figure out what the thing on the table is. I like the detail of the mirror''s frame and the overall hue, but I think a little more light would have helped.</td>', 'Even after brightening up my monitor settings, I still couldn''t figure out what the thing on the table is. I like the detail of the mirror''s frame and the overall hue, but I think a little more light would have helped.', '2007-02-02 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
