(3321047, 461509, 69387, '<td valign="top">Awww! What a cute pooch! I like the clarity of your image and the humor you want to convey. However, I think it borderlines animal abuse ;) I would have given this a point lower but because of your very patient (or perhaps terrified) subject''s outstanding cooperation, a 7!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-12 15:24:46.</i></td>', 'Awww! What a cute pooch! I like the clarity of your image and the humor you want to convey. However, I think it borderlines animal abuse ;) I would have given this a point lower but because of your very patient (or perhaps terrified) subject''s outstanding cooperation, a 7!', '2007-02-02 22:27:05.000000', '2007-02-12 15:24:46.000000', 1),
