(3321161, 460822, 18738, '<td valign="top">For a cute kiddie pic it''s good. The reflection in the eyes is a little unsettling,as it''s tilted and cut off.</td>', 'For a cute kiddie pic it''s good. The reflection in the eyes is a little unsettling,as it''s tilted and cut off.', '2007-02-02 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321168, 459860, 18738, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you intended for the reflection to be there, and I can appreciate that it adds definition to the glass, but it seems to me to detract from the purpose of the shot. You''ve captured the bubbles and the colour beautifully but the reflection destroys that. <br/> <br/>Also I think that this kind of shot is fine as a technical exercise or an advert but it doesn''t hold any sustaining interest for me.</td>', 'Perhaps you intended for the reflection to be there, and I can appreciate that it adds definition to the glass, but it seems to me to detract from the purpose of the shot. You''ve captured the bubbles and the colour beautifully but the reflection destroys that.  Also I think that this kind of shot is fine as a technical exercise or an advert but it doesn''t hold any sustaining interest for me.', '2007-02-02 23:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3321176, 461656, 18738, '<td valign="top">I find the composition, combined with the aggressive PP to be too violent. I think a much wider angle, perhaps with other objects would have been more effective. <br/> <br/>I like the green shadows around the milk, it seems to be travelling of its own accord.</td>', 'I find the composition, combined with the aggressive PP to be too violent. I think a much wider angle, perhaps with other objects would have been more effective.  I like the green shadows around the milk, it seems to be travelling of its own accord.', '2007-02-02 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
