(3333884, 459983, 66201, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, a real "inside view" that lets the viewer in on the secrecy of the cards...</td>', 'Great clarity, a real "inside view" that lets the viewer in on the secrecy of the cards...', '2007-02-06 07:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3333887, 461171, 66201, '<td valign="top">Witty title and a simple, neat, clean image.</td>', 'Witty title and a simple, neat, clean image.', '2007-02-06 07:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3333891, 461598, 66201, '<td valign="top">I love this idea: I think I would have liked a hand holding the newspaper...just to give the general composition some life...more than being a still life if you know what I mean?? Nice palette that carries through to the horizon. I like that the eye can move off from the table shot and on down the road...not many of these table shots have managed to do that: incorporate distance into the main theme of the image.</td>', 'I love this idea: I think I would have liked a hand holding the newspaper...just to give the general composition some life...more than being a still life if you know what I mean?? Nice palette that carries through to the horizon. I like that the eye can move off from the table shot and on down the road...not many of these table shots have managed to do that: incorporate distance into the main theme of the image.', '2007-02-06 07:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3333965, 459522, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s really a dreadful game, but I like the lighting and set up of your photo.</td>', 'It''s really a dreadful game, but I like the lighting and set up of your photo.', '2007-02-06 08:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3333973, 459300, 25355, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t recognise this game.... ;-)</td>', 'Well, I don''t recognise this game.... ;-)', '2007-02-06 08:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334168, 460286, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great detail and composition, and creative use of the challenge.</td>', 'Great detail and composition, and creative use of the challenge.', '2007-02-06 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334173, 460643, 70270, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, with a hint of the table at the bottom. Well done</td>', 'Very nice composition, with a hint of the table at the bottom. Well done', '2007-02-06 09:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334183, 458680, 70270, '<td valign="top">Great use of the challenge.  I really like the angle you used in this shot.  Even though you don''t see the table, its clearly a table-high angle. Focus is a little soft in the near field (a smaller aperture would help here) and highlights are a bit blown out at the top and far end.  Also would have been nice to see a figure in one of the chairs at the end of the aisle, perhaps bent over a book, but still very nice as it is.  8</td>', 'Great use of the challenge.  I really like the angle you used in this shot.  Even though you don''t see the table, its clearly a table-high angle. Focus is a little soft in the near field (a smaller aperture would help here) and highlights are a bit blown out at the top and far end.  Also would have been nice to see a figure in one of the chairs at the end of the aisle, perhaps bent over a book, but still very nice as it is.  8', '2007-02-06 09:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334195, 460865, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good catch (or nice idea, if its a pet hamster or something).  Unfortunately the focus is behind the subject, which leaves the edges unsharp and ruins the silhouette you are going for by softening the edges too much.</td>', 'Good catch (or nice idea, if its a pet hamster or something).  Unfortunately the focus is behind the subject, which leaves the edges unsharp and ruins the silhouette you are going for by softening the edges too much.', '2007-02-06 09:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334206, 460033, 70270, '<td valign="top">Was this a Shallow DOF outtake?</td>', 'Was this a Shallow DOF outtake?', '2007-02-06 09:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334212, 461330, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and idea, but too small.  Looks like the B&amp;W conversion could be a little stronger ... no strong blacks and whites.</td>', 'Nice shot and idea, but too small.  Looks like the B&W conversion could be a little stronger ... no strong blacks and whites.', '2007-02-06 09:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334342, 461052, 60495, '<td valign="top">Bueatiful image but to me it does not really have the perspective of being shot from a camera set on the table top. 6</td>', 'Bueatiful image but to me it does not really have the perspective of being shot from a camera set on the table top. 6', '2007-02-06 10:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334449, 460214, 72833, '<td valign="top">wow, nice use of lighting. it adds a lot of movement to the image. this meets the challenge very well.</td>', 'wow, nice use of lighting. it adds a lot of movement to the image. this meets the challenge very well.', '2007-02-06 11:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3334457, 459646, 72833, '<td valign="top">the way you worked the background adds unity and proportion to the image. i think it was smart to show the person''s face in the background so that the hand isn''t just randomly there. great job.</td>', 'the way you worked the background adds unity and proportion to the image. i think it was smart to show the person''s face in the background so that the hand isn''t just randomly there. great job.', '2007-02-06 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
