(3336070, 459346, 70270, '<td valign="top">You''re just joking here, right?  Its a snapshot of a table, not even an on the table shot, and not a very good one at that.  I hope you''re trying for the Brown.  If you''re not, sorry.  If this is a legit try for a blue, my first suggestion would be to pick your subject more carefully.  Starting with a half eaten plate of pasta is not likely to curry you much favor with the voters.  Also, watch your backgrounds.  The bike is very distracting, as is the refrigerator, and neither does much to help the image.  The tomatoes are nice, as is the light streaming in from the window, but the candle is out of place.  Who eats by candlelight in the middle of the day?</td>', 'You''re just joking here, right?  Its a snapshot of a table, not even an on the table shot, and not a very good one at that.  I hope you''re trying for the Brown.  If you''re not, sorry.  If this is a legit try for a blue, my first suggestion would be to pick your subject more carefully.  Starting with a half eaten plate of pasta is not likely to curry you much favor with the voters.  Also, watch your backgrounds.  The bike is very distracting, as is the refrigerator, and neither does much to help the image.  The tomatoes are nice, as is the light streaming in from the window, but the candle is out of place.  Who eats by candlelight in the middle of the day?', '2007-02-06 18:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336077, 460703, 70270, '<td valign="top">I must be missing the table here.  Nice shot of a sax, but the B&amp;W conversion is kind of muddy.  No rich blacks, and its kinda dark, too.</td>', 'I must be missing the table here.  Nice shot of a sax, but the B&W conversion is kind of muddy.  No rich blacks, and its kinda dark, too.', '2007-02-06 18:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336086, 459973, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, nice angle, though would be better if some light were hitting her face.  Could be bigger, too.  Doesn''t look like it meets the challenge, but my guess is it does and the camera was sitting on a picnic table and shooting upwards.  Nothing in the challenge said you have to shoot across the table.  I just wish this was bigger.  I''m gonna give you a 6 ... not great, but my first inclination was to give you a 3.</td>', 'Interesting picture, nice angle, though would be better if some light were hitting her face.  Could be bigger, too.  Doesn''t look like it meets the challenge, but my guess is it does and the camera was sitting on a picnic table and shooting upwards.  Nothing in the challenge said you have to shoot across the table.  I just wish this was bigger.  I''m gonna give you a 6 ... not great, but my first inclination was to give you a 3.', '2007-02-06 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3336087, 461353, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, tho I think the figure could have moved closer to keep head out of shadows.  You also appear to have a white balance problem here, unless you were going for the orange-yellow cast.</td>', 'Nice idea, tho I think the figure could have moved closer to keep head out of shadows.  You also appear to have a white balance problem here, unless you were going for the orange-yellow cast.', '2007-02-06 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
