(3336100, 461606, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but lighting is kind of harsh and the reflected lights in the bowl are distracting.  Seems to be oversharpened and a bit unnatural looking.  6</td>', 'Nice idea, but lighting is kind of harsh and the reflected lights in the bowl are distracting.  Seems to be oversharpened and a bit unnatural looking.  6', '2007-02-06 18:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
