(3336859, 461491, 62318, '<td valign="top">A fairly typical shot here. I expected a few of the same type theme. It is well executed though. Maybe a bit too much black space, but maybe it was needed... At first glance I did not notice the smoke coming from the cigar. This is what really makes the picture. I might have liked the smoke to be a little more prevelant, hopefully others catch it as well. Maybe a bit more in the depth of field department might have helped??? Without the smoke, just an average picture, but with the whole cigar smoke thing going on highly rated.</td>', 'A fairly typical shot here. I expected a few of the same type theme. It is well executed though. Maybe a bit too much black space, but maybe it was needed... At first glance I did not notice the smoke coming from the cigar. This is what really makes the picture. I might have liked the smoke to be a little more prevelant, hopefully others catch it as well. Maybe a bit more in the depth of field department might have helped??? Without the smoke, just an average picture, but with the whole cigar smoke thing going on highly rated.', '2007-02-06 22:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
