(3336954, 461401, 67841, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting tons of DNMCs on this - the thing is, it would have been really great to do the shot in this manner AND make it meet the challenge by placing something to make it look like it actually was on a table... a table top perhaps laid on the road.  THAT would have brought in the element of humor &amp; creativity.<br/> <br/>Anyway, on to the letter of the ''law''... <br/> <br/>It''s decently executed, but not spectacular and it is missing overt interest  - the clouds are nice, but it would have been more interesting to see more of the winding road, you know, winding off into the distance, maybe? That would have possibly been great use of leading lines for the clouds or even brought a central interest to the composition.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting tons of DNMCs on this - the thing is, it would have been really great to do the shot in this manner AND make it meet the challenge by placing something to make it look like it actually was on a table... a table top perhaps laid on the road.  THAT would have brought in the element of humor & creativity. Anyway, on to the letter of the ''law''...  It''s decently executed, but not spectacular and it is missing overt interest  - the clouds are nice, but it would have been more interesting to see more of the winding road, you know, winding off into the distance, maybe? That would have possibly been great use of leading lines for the clouds or even brought a central interest to the composition.', '2007-02-06 22:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
