(3338363, 460906, 56658, '<td valign="top">very coo and funny shot. I like the DOF but I think it would have been at least .5 higher if you DOF was largeenough for everything. great job.</td>', 'very coo and funny shot. I like the DOF but I think it would have been at least .5 higher if you DOF was largeenough for everything. great job.', '2007-02-07 07:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3338368, 458465, 50674, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic shot Gurrý, and sooo close to top 10. Well done, you are getting better and better at still-life shots. Proud of you. :)<br/>Edit the next day Whoopy, you made top 10, atta girl!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-08 11:02:09.</i></td>', 'What a fantastic shot Gurrý, and sooo close to top 10. Well done, you are getting better and better at still-life shots. Proud of you. :)Edit the next day Whoopy, you made top 10, atta girl!', '2007-02-07 07:12:24.000000', '2007-02-08 11:02:09.000000', 0),
