(3338442, 461319, 23394, '<td valign="top">what a dilemma: ruin the shot by showing part of the table, or shoot it the way you envision it and hope for the best...<br/> <br/></td>', 'what a dilemma: ruin the shot by showing part of the table, or shoot it the way you envision it and hope for the best... ', '2007-02-07 07:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3338447, 461536, 66597, '<td valign="top">What the *&amp;#@? I didn''t vote on this, but would have given it a 9 or 10. I can''t believe voters didn''t understand that you put the camera on a table and took a photo of your legs. I didn''t think a table had to be in the photo! This is just beautiful. What a sense of mood you evoke here. Into faves.</td>', 'What the *&#@? I didn''t vote on this, but would have given it a 9 or 10. I can''t believe voters didn''t understand that you put the camera on a table and took a photo of your legs. I didn''t think a table had to be in the photo! This is just beautiful. What a sense of mood you evoke here. Into faves.', '2007-02-07 07:45:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3338466, 461319, 48471, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i> what a dilemma: ruin the shot by showing part of the table, or shoot it the way you envision it and hope for the best... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I hope the Photographer doesn''t have that dilemma: he just shows the best and it''s up to the voters to educate their eyes. People should have trusted more, this shot could have been taken from the table and it doesn''t matter whether it really was.<br/> <br/>Those eyes on the screen, those eyes are mean!</td>', 'Originally posted by skiprow: what a dilemma: ruin the shot by showing part of the table, or shoot it the way you envision it and hope for the best...   I hope the Photographer doesn''t have that dilemma: he just shows the best and it''s up to the voters to educate their eyes. People should have trusted more, this shot could have been taken from the table and it doesn''t matter whether it really was. Those eyes on the screen, those eyes are mean!', '2007-02-07 07:53:47.000000', NULL, 0),
