(3339140, 460286, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to finish voting and missed this one - what a truly wonderful shot.  Excellent composition, great subject, very warm and inviting and real.  Thanks so much for sharing this!  (And I''ll bet the bread was good, too - nice bonus!)</td>', 'I didn''t get to finish voting and missed this one - what a truly wonderful shot.  Excellent composition, great subject, very warm and inviting and real.  Thanks so much for sharing this!  (And I''ll bet the bread was good, too - nice bonus!)', '2007-02-07 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 0),
