(3339931, 461696, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!. I kind of thought this was yours. I think it needs a little more ambient light or some reflected light. I seemed a bit dark overall. Did you flip the image? The place setting is backwards. Hmmm...</td>', 'This is so cute!. I kind of thought this was yours. I think it needs a little more ambient light or some reflected light. I seemed a bit dark overall. Did you flip the image? The place setting is backwards. Hmmm...', '2007-02-07 14:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
