(3345641, 459810, 57882, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by justamistere:</b></div><hr/><i> Please explain this to me. Where/How is the emphasis on a table as a subject?<br/>My monitor is unfortunately on the dark side here, I''ll look at it on other monitors later. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My understanding of this challenge, and my goal with the shot was to present a table perspective of an interesting subject.  I chose to have my subject be something that is alike and different at the same time, and in harmony with the gradually dissappearing table.</td>', 'Originally posted by justamistere: Please explain this to me. Where/How is the emphasis on a table as a subject?My monitor is unfortunately on the dark side here, I''ll look at it on other monitors later.   My understanding of this challenge, and my goal with the shot was to present a table perspective of an interesting subject.  I chose to have my subject be something that is alike and different at the same time, and in harmony with the gradually dissappearing table.', '2007-02-08 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
