(3731591, 459899, 11800, '<td valign="top">The lighting is beautiful. Sure, I think a little light coming in behind the subject would help define his shape more, but the face and eyes really carry all the weight in the photo. <br/>Somehow, I imagine him with a notebook in front of him. A scientist on the road to a discovery. It reminds me of a photo that would have been seen in "Life" during the 50''s.</td>', 'The lighting is beautiful. Sure, I think a little light coming in behind the subject would help define his shape more, but the face and eyes really carry all the weight in the photo. Somehow, I imagine him with a notebook in front of him. A scientist on the road to a discovery. It reminds me of a photo that would have been seen in "Life" during the 50''s.', '2007-06-03 11:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
